# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (the repo root). Allow-list: nothing is
# sent to the Docker build except the files named here, so .env, data/,
# uploads/, virtual environments, PDFs and truth files never reach an image.
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/app/
!eval/datasets/test/MANIFEST.sha256
!eval/handmade/CHANGELOG.md
!eval/handmade/MANIFEST.sha256
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
